# Realytica Site (Expo) environment. Copy to mobile/.env and adjust.
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables reach the app, and they are compiled into it —
# never put a secret here.

# The server the pairing screen suggests. Leave unset for the production server
# (https://realytica.gnanalytica.com). For local development against
# `pnpm dev:api` use your computer's address as the phone sees it:
#   iOS simulator / web:  http://localhost:5174
#   Android emulator:     http://10.0.2.2:5174
#   A real phone on Wi-Fi: http://<your computer's LAN IP>:5174
EXPO_PUBLIC_REALYTICA_SERVER=
